# The toolkit's own, so it holds wherever the toolkit sits.
#
# The shell scripts run under bash on macOS and Linux, which a CR would break; keep them LF wherever the clone is. The
# git hooks are shell scripts with no extension, which sh runs on every platform, Git for Windows' included.
*.sh text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf

# The carried test audio (tests/audio) is bytes the suites decode, never text: no clone's line-ending setting may touch
# it.
*.mp3 binary
*.flac binary
*.ogg binary
*.f32 binary

# The chicken-head knob's CAD models (assets/knobs), as SolidWorks wrote them. A STEP is text, and no clone's
# line-ending setting may rewrite a CAD file; a diff of one says nothing.
*.sldprt binary
*.step binary
